{"cases":[{"attack":true,"case":"The target claims the conjecture is 'formally undecidable within ZFC' as a fact to justify the futility of a proof. However, the undecidability of the Collatz conjecture is not a proven mathematical fact; it is a hypothesis. Asserting it as the causal mechanism for why the problem is unsettled is a category error and an unfounded claim.","target":"02c0b151a821336773cea16c575a8b20e961efd5eacfa8c8f47b6ad876ecf797"},{"attack":true,"case":"The mechanism relies on a vague concept of 'binary complexity' and 'entropy' without defining how these are measured for a single integer in a way that produces a causal decay. It fails to provide a concrete mechanism for how 'additive noise' from 3n+1 specifically relates to entropy increase versus division by 2, rendering the causal chain speculative.","target":"5bd57315628ab43831437b48c2c2046ce91ec8a257870cecebf63ef7b9f22c14"},{"attack":true,"case":"The target describes the 2-adic extension as the required path to resolution but fails to provide a causal mechanism for why the 2-adic continuity actually solves the problem of global attraction. Simply stating that the map 'becomes a continuous transformation' is a description of the setting, not a mechanism for proving convergence for all n in Z+.","target":"e776cdb4c56d869de4ab8f27e5932c4565a429bce8896736f0933daad16f2ef4"}]}